{"2617340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terminator: Survivors", "steam_appid": 2617340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Play as a survivor in this open world return to the iconic Terminator universe set in the aftermath of Judgment Day.</strong><br><br>Four years have passed since the day humanity almost disappeared. The truth behind this apocalyptic event has yet to be uncovered. You emerge from a shelter to try and re-establish a semblance of society, only to discover a world ravaged by Skynet, who seem hell-bent on eliminating you and the last remnants of humanity. <br><br>Fight the first Skynet prototypes and help the Resistance rise from the ashes of civilization. But beware, the legendary T-800 is after you, and staying in one place for too long could prove fatal.<br>Investigate and discover the truth behind the nuclear apocalypse, Skynet and the Terminator threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka